(6495174, 964844, 86799, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Sharp where needed, soft where not.  Smooth color, nice balance to the composition.  Should go high.</td>', 'Love this.  Sharp where needed, soft where not.  Smooth color, nice balance to the composition.  Should go high.', '2011-08-06 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
