(6495222, 965252, 49109, '<td valign="top">Wow, a lot of work this time - and it was worth the effort! Not sure, though, if flipping the image didn''t create too much confusion. Anyway, this is a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Wow, a lot of work this time - and it was worth the effort! Not sure, though, if flipping the image didn''t create too much confusion. Anyway, this is a ribbon contender.', '2011-08-06 09:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
