(6495348, 965212, 28427, '<td valign="top">The most sold orchid, the Phalaenopsis, is still the most beautiful with a vast pallet of colors</td>', 'The most sold orchid, the Phalaenopsis, is still the most beautiful with a vast pallet of colors', '2011-08-06 12:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495386, 964748, 114225, '<td valign="top">This was one of my ideas for the challenge as well. My little boy is only 3.5 weeks away!<br/>FYI, I think I would have used less of a border. I want to see the details in the items, and that border is making it difficult due to squishing the image.</td>', 'This was one of my ideas for the challenge as well. My little boy is only 3.5 weeks away!FYI, I think I would have used less of a border. I want to see the details in the items, and that border is making it difficult due to squishing the image.', '2011-08-06 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495387, 965188, 114225, '<td valign="top">I understand the play of light and shadow, but I''m not finding it effective here. Instead, I think a tighter crop just including the basket and light would have been nicer.</td>', 'I understand the play of light and shadow, but I''m not finding it effective here. Instead, I think a tighter crop just including the basket and light would have been nicer.', '2011-08-06 13:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495388, 965166, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition you chose and the depth of field use for pulling out the details.</td>', 'I really like the composition you chose and the depth of field use for pulling out the details.', '2011-08-06 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495390, 965094, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract, makes the sun feel smooched by a giant.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract, makes the sun feel smooched by a giant.', '2011-08-06 13:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495396, 964788, 114225, '<td valign="top">Something feels a bit off to me. Like the orange channel has been desaturated, which makes her skin tones very unnatural.</td>', 'Something feels a bit off to me. Like the orange channel has been desaturated, which makes her skin tones very unnatural.', '2011-08-06 13:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495397, 965168, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool photo with very neat lighting of the center. I''m not really seeing this as pastel, but then again my definition may not be complete.</td>', 'Cool photo with very neat lighting of the center. I''m not really seeing this as pastel, but then again my definition may not be complete.', '2011-08-06 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495398, 964678, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great overall composition with many layers to look at. However, there are some things which really hurt this photo in my view:<br/>1) Lack of sharpness anywhere<br/>2) The halo effect around the people people<br/>3) The massive amount of noise<br/> <br/>I hope this helps.</td>', 'Great overall composition with many layers to look at. However, there are some things which really hurt this photo in my view:1) Lack of sharpness anywhere2) The halo effect around the people people3) The massive amount of noise I hope this helps.', '2011-08-06 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495401, 965255, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, a place I would love to spend time exploring. I''m not really finding this to contain pastels, all the colors seem pretty deep.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, a place I would love to spend time exploring. I''m not really finding this to contain pastels, all the colors seem pretty deep.', '2011-08-06 13:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495403, 965095, 114225, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit pissed off, although this is a fun photo.<br/>I seem to see some very sharp noise in the background. I''m wondering if maybe there was noise and then sharpening actions really make it stand out.</td>', 'She looks a bit pissed off, although this is a fun photo.I seem to see some very sharp noise in the background. I''m wondering if maybe there was noise and then sharpening actions really make it stand out.', '2011-08-06 13:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495404, 965190, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, although I feel something is just a bit off with the colors. Almost like the greens have been very desaturated and the blues overly so.</td>', 'I like the idea here, although I feel something is just a bit off with the colors. Almost like the greens have been very desaturated and the blues overly so.', '2011-08-06 13:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495409, 965021, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great find and good use of depth of field to make this more interesting.</td>', 'Great find and good use of depth of field to make this more interesting.', '2011-08-06 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495412, 965260, 114225, '<td valign="top">The blown out highlights on the chest are really unflattering to the model and the photo.</td>', 'The blown out highlights on the chest are really unflattering to the model and the photo.', '2011-08-06 13:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495414, 964866, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous scene and very well composed. But to my eyes, I see nothing here that resembles pastels.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous scene and very well composed. But to my eyes, I see nothing here that resembles pastels.', '2011-08-06 13:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495415, 965051, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of leading lines, especially with the foreground rock line.</td>', 'Wonderful use of leading lines, especially with the foreground rock line.', '2011-08-06 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495416, 965273, 33352, '<td valign="top">The wool has "a light, pale tint of color" for pastel the contrast of the other colors a little heavy.....6</td>', 'The wool has "a light, pale tint of color" for pastel the contrast of the other colors a little heavy.....6', '2011-08-06 13:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495418, 964691, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. The panoramic style fits this image very well, and that boat adds an extra highlight to the photo.</td>', 'Well done. The panoramic style fits this image very well, and that boat adds an extra highlight to the photo.', '2011-08-06 13:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495424, 965287, 114225, '<td valign="top">A great scene with a nice hint of action. But you need to make sure to watch out for artifacts when saving for the web (look at the edges of the clouds and notice how they have weird squiggles).</td>', 'A great scene with a nice hint of action. But you need to make sure to watch out for artifacts when saving for the web (look at the edges of the clouds and notice how they have weird squiggles).', '2011-08-06 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495425, 965276, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for the challenge using lighter pastel tones...7 bumping...8</td>', 'Nice concept for the challenge using lighter pastel tones...7 bumping...8', '2011-08-06 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495429, 964299, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection shot, with the exception of the blown highlights of the sky. Definitely need to make sure you watch for those while shooing.</td>', 'Lovely reflection shot, with the exception of the blown highlights of the sky. Definitely need to make sure you watch for those while shooing.', '2011-08-06 13:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495433, 965175, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea, and overall, the execution is pretty sound. May I suggest the following two points:<br/>1) Ensure that the blue pencil doesn''t encroach on the right side of the image. A photo like this scream that it needs symmetry, and that slight misplacement really hurts<br/>2) Again with the symmetry, the shadows in this photo nearly eliminate that, so I would suggest another light coming from the left.</td>', 'I do like the idea, and overall, the execution is pretty sound. May I suggest the following two points:1) Ensure that the blue pencil doesn''t encroach on the right side of the image. A photo like this scream that it needs symmetry, and that slight misplacement really hurts2) Again with the symmetry, the shadows in this photo nearly eliminate that, so I would suggest another light coming from the left.', '2011-08-06 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495438, 964394, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo is very nicely composed and has some spectacular colors. But for me, the blown out sky ruins it. We get to see the nice sky colors in the reflection, but not the actual sky.</td>', 'This photo is very nicely composed and has some spectacular colors. But for me, the blown out sky ruins it. We get to see the nice sky colors in the reflection, but not the actual sky.', '2011-08-06 13:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495440, 964376, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool photo. Was the sky really that color?</td>', 'This is a very cool photo. Was the sky really that color?', '2011-08-06 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495448, 965152, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but I would like to suggest a few improvements:<br/>1) There isn''t really anything that is well in focus. Maybe using a shallow depth of field you could have had the legs in focus while blurring other parts<br/>2) The lighting is a bit too cool for me. This scene screams soft/warm light like from candles or a setting sun<br/>3) Where is the water? (and maybe bubbles)<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but I would like to suggest a few improvements:1) There isn''t really anything that is well in focus. Maybe using a shallow depth of field you could have had the legs in focus while blurring other parts2) The lighting is a bit too cool for me. This scene screams soft/warm light like from candles or a setting sun3) Where is the water? (and maybe bubbles) Hope this helps.', '2011-08-06 13:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
