(6499520, 965160, 101702, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to sound like a bore as you will probably get lots of comments about the border but I feel compelled. This is a beautiful shot with a great colour palette but it is spoiled by the unnecessary border which adds nothing but detracts so much. Perfect depth of field and clarity in all the important places.</td>', 'I don''t want to sound like a bore as you will probably get lots of comments about the border but I feel compelled. This is a beautiful shot with a great colour palette but it is spoiled by the unnecessary border which adds nothing but detracts so much. Perfect depth of field and clarity in all the important places.', '2011-08-09 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499521, 965152, 70921, '<td valign="top">WOW nice legs but to the photo... good diagonal with legs, nice depth of field with bathtub slightly soft, 3 glass ducks add to a good background, need more drops of water if you''re going to have the single drop midway on her right leg.  White distracting splotches of the back of the bathtub above and halfway between knees and feet. Lighting slightly harsh on ankle and toes.</td>', 'WOW nice legs but to the photo... good diagonal with legs, nice depth of field with bathtub slightly soft, 3 glass ducks add to a good background, need more drops of water if you''re going to have the single drop midway on her right leg.  White distracting splotches of the back of the bathtub above and halfway between knees and feet. Lighting slightly harsh on ankle and toes.', '2011-08-09 17:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499522, 964695, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good composition and color, focus and depth of field</td>', 'Good composition and color, focus and depth of field', '2011-08-09 17:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
