(6499526, 965095, 70921, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat, great focus and detail... the blue blanket and especially the colored boa are distracting... I would rather have just the cat and the nice pastel background.  The focus on the main plain of the cats face and whiskers is GREAT.</td>', 'Lovely cat, great focus and detail... the blue blanket and especially the colored boa are distracting... I would rather have just the cat and the nice pastel background.  The focus on the main plain of the cats face and whiskers is GREAT.', '2011-08-09 17:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499527, 965276, 120058, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a much higher score if the focus was really sharp, but the waterdrops are a bit blurry and the reflection from the flash is a bit annoying. The colours are really nice! Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'I would have given this a much higher score if the focus was really sharp, but the waterdrops are a bit blurry and the reflection from the flash is a bit annoying. The colours are really nice! Perfect for the challenge.', '2011-08-09 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
