(6499532, 965278, 70921, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition with child 2/3rds into the photo.  Nice lighting but not enough detail in child''s face and doesn''t look in focus while people in the background appear to be sharper.  Would have made a great composition even better "flipped" with the child facing left so when the eye came into the photo it would come into the face rather than back of child''s head.  BUT all that said taking off 3 points for the lack on focus on main subject (the child)</td>', 'Wonderful composition with child 2/3rds into the photo.  Nice lighting but not enough detail in child''s face and doesn''t look in focus while people in the background appear to be sharper.  Would have made a great composition even better "flipped" with the child facing left so when the eye came into the photo it would come into the face rather than back of child''s head.  BUT all that said taking off 3 points for the lack on focus on main subject (the child)', '2011-08-09 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
