(6500686, 965140, 96751, '<td valign="top">So, what?  You just drop in every time you get a hankering for a ribbon..????<br/> <br/>Congrats - stellar image.  I just love all the comments that say "I hate glass shots, but this one is [superlative of choice]".  You ARE the Glass Queen.</td>', 'So, what?  You just drop in every time you get a hankering for a ribbon..???? Congrats - stellar image.  I just love all the comments that say "I hate glass shots, but this one is [superlative of choice]".  You ARE the Glass Queen.', '2011-08-10 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
