(6500693, 964569, 43463, '<td valign="top">????What is this doing down here???? This was one of my handful of 10''s. I loved this photo - serene and tranquil is the feeling it gave me. I loved the composition of elements and the soft hues as well.</td>', '????What is this doing down here???? This was one of my handful of 10''s. I loved this photo - serene and tranquil is the feeling it gave me. I loved the composition of elements and the soft hues as well.', '2011-08-10 12:50:30.000000', NULL, 0),
