(6500799, 964319, 43463, '<td valign="top">Lovely curves and lines of color in this simple and pleasing abstract of the beach. Congrats on the top 10 placement and also on getting a new photo in the top 5 in your profile.</td>', 'Lovely curves and lines of color in this simple and pleasing abstract of the beach. Congrats on the top 10 placement and also on getting a new photo in the top 5 in your profile.', '2011-08-10 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6500808, 965286, 43463, '<td valign="top">The predominant soft, pale hues in this photo and the lighting really make this an inviting space that beckons one to take a seat by the window and relax. This could be a photo in a brochure for showcasing pastel/soft colors for paint or an HGTV add showing off simple &amp; elegent room design and color.</td>', 'The predominant soft, pale hues in this photo and the lighting really make this an inviting space that beckons one to take a seat by the window and relax. This could be a photo in a brochure for showcasing pastel/soft colors for paint or an HGTV add showing off simple & elegent room design and color.', '2011-08-10 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6500814, 965140, 29011, '<td valign="top">Lovely elegant image. The little touches like the little glass bubbles? make this special.</td>', 'Lovely elegant image. The little touches like the little glass bubbles? make this special.', '2011-08-10 14:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6500815, 965252, 29011, '<td valign="top">A most refreshing spin on curly paper. The color pallete is perfect for this shot. Makes it airy. I don''t feel the image is too busy.</td>', 'A most refreshing spin on curly paper. The color pallete is perfect for this shot. Makes it airy. I don''t feel the image is too busy.', '2011-08-10 14:02:41.000000', NULL, 0),
