(6500997, 965031, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your newest ribbon. I love the light, texture, and color you have here. This was one of my 10s - I can feel the softness of the feather -- it almost makes me sneeze to look at it -- and the graduated drops are icing on the cake. Thanks for sharing the ''recipe''.</td>', 'Congratulations on your newest ribbon. I love the light, texture, and color you have here. This was one of my 10s - I can feel the softness of the feather -- it almost makes me sneeze to look at it -- and the graduated drops are icing on the cake. Thanks for sharing the ''recipe''.', '2011-08-10 18:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
