(6501618, 964376, 117474, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Well, the comment he left you (dfz) is a lot more than the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=962828" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">''</a> he left someone else. And that was marked helpful! <br/> <br/>Were it I the shot might have been square cropped hanging to the right. I don''t know that I think the woman to the right adds much to the image, but I consider the horizon, steam and water turbulence the focal points of this image so that''s why I said that.<br/>Really nice colours though. Nice and simple.</td>', 'Hmm. Well, the comment he left you (dfz) is a lot more than the '' he left someone else. And that was marked helpful!  Were it I the shot might have been square cropped hanging to the right. I don''t know that I think the woman to the right adds much to the image, but I consider the horizon, steam and water turbulence the focal points of this image so that''s why I said that.Really nice colours though. Nice and simple.', '2011-08-11 12:21:45.000000', NULL, 0),
