(6502387, 964324, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent finish - makes getting up at such an earthly hour worth-while.  I was down in Cornwall at the same time, I had promised I would make myself get up early, early some days.  Did I?  Nope, not once.  I''ll never make a landscape photographer.<br/></td>', 'Excellent finish - makes getting up at such an earthly hour worth-while.  I was down in Cornwall at the same time, I had promised I would make myself get up early, early some days.  Did I?  Nope, not once.  I''ll never make a landscape photographer.', '2011-08-12 06:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
