(6505647, 964569, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Focus and dof are perfect for the mood.  And it''s not burnt out at all - look how carefully controlled the light end of the scale is - you can see where the bird''s white head meets the hazy sky. You really have to keep exploring different subjects like this - see where they take you.  We''ll be waiting ;-)</td>', 'Nice work!  Focus and dof are perfect for the mood.  And it''s not burnt out at all - look how carefully controlled the light end of the scale is - you can see where the bird''s white head meets the hazy sky. You really have to keep exploring different subjects like this - see where they take you.  We''ll be waiting ;-)', '2011-08-16 00:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6507575, 965177, 50695, '<td valign="top">ha, this is beautiful. you hide well.</td>', 'ha, this is beautiful. you hide well.', '2011-08-17 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
